###         - Significance index SI
###         - Schedule sensitivity index SSI
###         - Cruciality index CRI(t) (I added (t) since CRI can also be used for cost)
##############################################################################

# Calculate the sensitivity metrics (time sensitivity only)
CI, SI, SSI, CRIt, _ = calculate_sensitivity_metrics(simulated_schedules, False)

